1
00:00:00,815 --> 00:00:02,515
(Amy:)Ready for the
aquarium?

2
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:06,023
(Sheldon:)I am. You know, and in an effort
to reduce awkwardness

3
00:00:06,087 --> 00:00:09,687
(Sheldon:)as we learn how to function as friends,
I printed out a list

4
00:00:09,757 --> 00:00:13,297
(Sheldon:)of safe topics
for polite conversation.

5
00:00:13,361 --> 00:00:16,161
(Amy:)If that makes you
more comfortable.

6
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:19,300
(Sheldon:)If there were a list of things
that make me more comfortable,

7
00:00:19,367 --> 00:00:21,767
(Sheldon:)lists would be
on the top of that list.

8
00:00:21,836 --> 00:00:24,576
(Sheldon:)Okay, now... Oh.

9
00:00:24,639 --> 00:00:28,109
"Since last we spoke,
have you acquired any pets?"

10
00:00:28,175 --> 00:00:29,645
(Amy:)No. You?

11
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,750
(Howard:)No.

12
00:00:33,114 --> 00:00:35,914
Um, "Since last we spoke,
have you planned

13
00:00:35,983 --> 00:00:37,983
or gone on any vacations?"

14
00:00:38,052 --> 00:00:40,392
(Amy:)I might go visit my aunt
next week.

15
00:00:40,454 --> 00:00:41,984
(Sheldon:)Mm. Your aunt
in Modesto?

16
00:00:42,056 --> 00:00:43,756
(Amy:)No, the one in
Bakersfield.

17
00:00:43,824 --> 00:00:45,964
(Sheldon:)Bakersfield. I see.

18
00:00:46,027 --> 00:00:48,827
(Sheldon:)Where has this list been
all my life?

19
00:00:51,198 --> 00:00:53,038
(Soup Kitchen Manager:)We're gonna have you
washing dishes.

20
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:56,270
(Soup Kitchen Manager:)Uh, aprons and rubber gloves
are here... just...

21
00:00:56,337 --> 00:00:57,367
(Soup Kitchen Manager:)scrape, wash and stack.

22
00:00:57,438 --> 00:00:58,938
(Soup Kitchen Manager:)If you need me, I'll be around.

23
00:00:59,006 --> 00:01:02,806
(Howard:)So we don't even get to be up front
where the action is?

